Difficulty:Medium
Description:It is your second main phase. You control Spitemare (3/3) and have Flame Slash in hand, with one red mana floating. The opponent is at 4 life and controls a tapped Silent Arbiter. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-dealt-damage-trigger-overkill | Spitemare's trigger copies the full damage dealt to it, not the damage needed to kill it, and resolves after it has died using its last-known information (CR 603.2, 608.2h): Flame Slash your own Spitemare for 4 and it deals 4 to the opponent; Flame Slash can't hit a player, and the 1/5 Arbiter doesn't help
